SELECT Street, City, Zip, State FROM schools s JOIN satscores t ON s.CDSCode = t.cds WHERE t.NumTstTakr > 0 ORDER BY (CAST(t.NumGE1500 AS REAL) / t.NumTstTakr) ASC LIMIT 1;

## Explanation
The query joins the `schools` and `satscores` tables on `CDSCode` = `cds` to link school addresses with SAT performance data. It filters for schools with `NumTstTakr > 0` to avoid division by zero. The excellence rate is computed as `CAST(t.NumGE1500 AS REAL) / t.NumTstTakr` for accurate floating

